        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-23T14:56:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"trudge\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trudge/48/2062_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> trudge:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span>Bracket 0: Normal/Athletic human.&nbsp; Argent Adept, Expatriette, Nightmist, the Scholar, Tachyon, Unity, Visionary, Wraith&nbsp;Next question: how many of the heroes can fly? <span></span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><span>Belatedly:&nbsp; <em>one of these</em><em> things is not like the others.</em> &nbsp;I may not own The Scholar, but I am reasonably certain that he is not physically \"normal\".</span></p>",
