        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-23T20:43:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, Nightmist is <span class=\"bbcode-i\">certainly</span> not <span class=\"bbcode-i\">physically</span> normal, being how she's mostly made of mist, or something…but her abilities come from the power she wields, not from any physical strength. Same with the Scholar - without that Philosopher's Stone, he probably wouldn't be too effective at anything which didn't involve talking (or sitting on his arse having a drink ;)).</p>",
