        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trudge/{size}/2062_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-24T03:26:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I didn't see anything in Scholar's deck indicating that he possesses superhuman strength.</p><p>If Form of Iron turns him into actual metal, then he likely has great strength while it's active, if only because he weights half a ton.</p><p>Other than that, he seems like a normal guy with a healing factor and the alchemist's stone.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
