      {
        "id": 68551,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-24T05:04:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Ironic\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/48/2171_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ironic:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And Donald Blake was just a guy, until he picked up the Staff of Ra. &nbsp;I think all of them are now something else, even on a physical level.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I can't tell if this was an intentional joke or not, but Dr. Donald Blake transforms into Marvel's Thor.&nbsp; Blake Washington, Jr. (which, I'm convinced, is an homage to Donald Blake) transforms into Ra.&nbsp; There have been times that I've wrongly labeled one of the characters with the other's name.<br><br>Dr. Donald Blake Washington, Jr takes the Walking Staff of Ra and becomes The Mighty Thor, God of the Sun…der!</p>",
