      {
        "id": 68554,
        "name": "Phantom5613",
        "username": "Phantom5613",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-24T23:36:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Ironic\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/48/2171_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ironic:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>trudge wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Bracket 0: Normal/Athletic human.&nbsp; Argent Adept, Expatriette, Nightmist, the Scholar, Tachyon, Unity, Visionary, Wraith&nbsp;Next question: how many of the heroes can fly?\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nBelatedly:&nbsp;<em>one of these</em><em> things is not like the others.</em> &nbsp;I may not own The Scholar, but I am reasonably certain that he is not physically \"normal\".\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>He does two damage when he hits someone with a rock, so…I guess it's actually kinda normal strength for someone hitting you with a pretty big rock.</p>",
